<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of European Cup rugby</p>
<p>union matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p>Dax (France) 69 Edinburgh (Scotland) 12 (halftime 31-9)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dax - Tries: Richard Dourthe 3, Mathieu Dourthe 2, Olivier</p>
<p>Magne 2, Patrice Labeyrie 2, Ugo Mola. Conversions: Richard</p>
<p>Dourthe 8. Penalty: Richard Dourthe.</p>
<p>Edinburgh - Penalties: Duncan Hodge 4.</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000.</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p>Caledonian (Scotland) 30 Brive (France) 32 (9-14)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Caledonian - Tries: Paul Rouse, David Officer, Philip</p>
<p>Simpson, Stuart Grimes. Conversions: Rowan Shepherd, Jonathan</p>
<p>Newton. Penalties: Shepherd 2.</p>
<p>Brive - Tries: Sebastian Carrat 2, Gerald Fabre, Didier</p>
<p>Casadei. Conversions: Christophe Lamaison 3. Penalties:</p>
<p>Lamaison. Drop goal: David Venditti.</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,608.</p>
</text>
